  "prefLabel": "Abfd 204.03 Role of Committee Staff in Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 204.03 Role of Committee Staff in Hearings. Unless called as witnesses, committee staff shall have no role in any hearing.\n\nSource. #7783, eff 10-26-02",
